+# Accounts Service
+
+Terminology for the multi-tenant banking accounts and support-case API.
+
+## Support cases
+
+**Support case**:
+A customer issue linked to an account and handled by one support-user assignee.
+_Avoid_: ticket, incident
+
+**Resolution**:
+The customer-visible explanation recorded when a support case is closed.
+_Avoid_: closure reason, internal note
+
+**Assignee**:
+The support user responsible for handling a particular support case.
+_Avoid_: account support assignment
