+# Record case resolutions as customer-visible comments
+
+When staff close a support case, the trimmed resolution is stored as a non-internal case comment authored by the closing user, rather than as a field on the case. This reuses the case conversation model and ensures customers can see how their issue was resolved without exposing staff-only notes.
